title: "Conditional Boundedness - Switching Control Architecture"
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
type: software

authors:
  - name: "Mettle Forge Lab"

repository-code: "https://github.com/MettleForgeLab/bounded-switching-architecture-specification"

