version: "v1.0.1"

date-released: 2026-02-15

abstract: >
  Conditional Boundedness presents a control-system architecture
  for governed language-model behavior. It develops a formal
  switching policy for conditional expansion, contraction, mode
  selection, and stopping within constitutional constraints.
  The repository includes architectural research, mathematical
  specifications, and perturbation-evaluation materials.
